<%- include('partials/head') %>
<main class="container py-5"><div class="legal">
  <a href="/">← HisabFlow</a>
  <h1 class="mt-3">Privacy</h1>
  <p class="muted">HisabFlow is an internship project built to demonstrate full-stack development. Please do not enter real customer details that you are not allowed to share.</p>
  <h2>What is stored</h2>
  <p>Your shop name, your name, your email, a hashed password (never the password itself), and the customers, phone numbers and transactions you enter.</p>
  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>One cookie keeps you signed in. It is HTTP-only and used for nothing else. There is no advertising and no analytics tracking.</p>
  <h2>Who can see your data</h2>
  <p>Only your signed-in account can read your customers and entries. Phone numbers are used only to open a WhatsApp reminder on your own device when you tap “Remind”.</p>
  <h2>Deleting your data</h2>
  <p>To have your account and records removed, contact the project owner.</p>
</div></main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
